opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Native MLX text and image embeddings through Swift"
description: """
This library runs Qwen3 text and Qwen3-VL image embedding models on Apple
silicon through MLX Swift. It provides an Eio interface and loads models
from local directories without a Python inference runtime or model server."""
